cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GeneSpeciesTreeVerdict, please cite the software version or commit used in your analysis."
title: "GeneSpeciesTreeVerdict"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Bilal"
    given-names: "Muhammad"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mbilal-OU/GeneSpeciesTreeVerdict"
url: "https://github.com/mbilal-OU/GeneSpeciesTreeVerdict"
license: MIT
version: 0.3.0
abstract: >-
  An evidence-integration, validation, and phylogenomic decision-support framework for
  comparing gene trees with a reference species tree, separating observations from causal
  claims, screening copy-number and duplication signals, quantifying topology discordance,
  benchmarking workflow decisions against known truth, and routing loci toward transparent
  follow-up analyses.
keywords:
  - phylogenetics
  - phylogenomics
  - gene tree
  - species tree
  - reconciliation
  - orthology
  - paralogy
  - discordance
  - decision support
  - benchmarking
